#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Entries for the Unsolved Economics databases (Manon's 16:15 orders, batch 1).

Two databases, 34 ladder-ordered records each:

  unsolved-economics            - The Unsolved Economics Database (public-harvest:
                                  the field's real famous unsolved problems,
                                  fact-checked)
  unsolved-economics-signature  - The Unsolved Economics Signature Database
                                  (the SAME 34 problems through the Signature
                                  lens; titles suffixed " (Signature Edition)",
                                  src signature, clearly labeled
                                  Signature-made, never presented as authentic
                                  public record)

Record schema: id, t, g, name, title, problem, background, why_it_matters,
signature_solution, description, how_it_works, key_points, requirements,
standards, citations, src, ladder_rank, ladder_tier, demo.

The public half's signature_solution carries a SHORT POINTER; the signature
half carries the FULL TREATMENT. Both open with the EXACT label:
"Signature-generated proposed solution -- not established science."

ID prefixes: JAH-USEC- (public) and JAH-USECS- (signature), verified free in
the manifest id_prefix values (zero hits) and in every shard index file of
jah-databases-data-1 (zero hits).

Numerical cores: hand-computed 2026-10-17, machine-verified by the demos
(see demos_unsolved_economics.py). Every demo prints real computed values,
asserts tight bounds (never float exact-equality), walks the Signature
solution approach step by step with adjustable assumptions, ends with
confirm/refute panels, and closes with the OK marker. The build
machine-executes all 68 demos before pages are written.

Ladder: 34 unique ranks, 1 = most approachable, 34 = most compounded;
tiers foundations (1-11), compounded (12-23), advanced (24-34).

Never the words "bat belt" anywhere. No website references. No Facebook.
Human-readable sentences and paragraphs throughout.
"""

